  "description": "USGS WBD 16-digit hydrologic units, 2026-09-02 national release, one Hilbert-sorted GeoParquet per HUC2 region with a bbox covering. Coverage is partial: USGS delineates this level only where a state chose to subdivide further, so most of the country has no units here. A missing unit means it was never delineated, not that the area has none; use HUC12 for complete coverage.",
